    "short_description": "Metal Max Xeno Reborn is an action JRPG with real-time battle and vehicle combat elements. Join Talis, a lone hunter, and search for allies in a vengeance-charged war against monsters &amp; robotic enemies. Learn new skills and collect and customize tanks as you journey through a devastated world.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cIt\u2019s unique. As much as JRPGs always seem to try to one-up each other on spectacle, there\u2019s nothing like a trio of tanks unloading their combined ordinance on a towering monstrosity of flesh and metal. And Metal Max Xeno Reborn seems to know it. It gets out of your way and lets you go.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Destructoid<br><br>\u201cMetal Max Xeno: Reborn not only feels like a far more complete and polished game than its immediate predecessor, but it\u2019s also true to the Metal Max experience. There\u2019s no JRPG quite like this desert-punk vehicular combat RPG, thanks to its rich post-apocalyptic setting brimming with content and deep customization options.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 Noisy Pixel<br><br>\u201cWith its tremendous take on the turn-based formula and creative vehicle/weapon customization, Reborn has one of the simplest and most addictive gameplay loops I\u2019ve ever experienced, even outperforming its larger JRPG cousins in that regard.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Movies Games and Tech<br>",
